  "rights": "Existing original project-generated fantasy illustrations. Selected reference tiles are browser captures of the existing fantasy-0.2 atlases; no new painting, stock, historical commercial-game or rejected PROPOSED art is introduced. Applicable original project/OpenAI output terms apply; no exclusivity asserted.",
  "processing": "Extract exact selected PNGs from df0b4dc. Remove only the browser-captured review-frame edges using the per-tile crop rectangles; encode lossless WebP. No repaint, generation, padding, blur, scene extension, tone change or stretching. Decoded RGB equals each source crop.",
